OR MANUFACTURE OR FULL-CURRENT TEST" (at 20 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top)) (uuid 862f5f49-2bf7-545a-9abe-d5e8c5b5250c)) (text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid cde1098a-73b2-5e8f-83a6-5883474a8e97)) (text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid ceaccd92-36c0-5c44-a0ed-55520cf1cb87)) (text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid e451dbe2-6e1b-51c1-b90b-68ca7e8f26c8)) (text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 273b1d6a-02dc-557a-a1e8-4823262e13d9)) (text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 287e1701-4144-5e90-bc6c-d0c4a315cf75)) (text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 69470f29-f786-5421-bd81-a0e8e6701119)))